     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nDear Distance list,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nA reminder that the closing date for applications for the widening participation scholarship scheme for the summer workshops is next Tuesday 15th June. These scholarships provide one free place for each of our summer workshops with the aim of encouraging participation\r\n in our workshops by scientists from countries with fewer resources, and from groups traditionally under-represented in wildlife science. For eligibility see:<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<a href=\"http://workshops.distancesampling.org/widening-participation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://workshops.distancesampling.org/widening-participation&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472837540000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1i95I2xMuR-6bFctDJ2Acy\">http://workshops.distancesampling.org/widening-participation</a><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nDetails of our courses can be found at:</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<a href=\"https://workshops.distancesampling.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://workshops.distancesampling.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472837540000&amp;usg=AOvVaw37whynSddX-BkMgFyAeb7q\">https://workshops.distancesampling.org/</a><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nBest wishes,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nLaura<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nDr L Marshall<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">Distance Development Team<br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">Centre for Research into Ecological &amp; Environmental Modelling</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">University of St. Andrews</p>\r\n<span></span><br>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
